Package: com.zmmo.iosrmt
Name: ZMMO iOS Remote
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: VNC-style remote desktop for iPhone.
 GPU-level screen mirroring via CARenderServer.
 Touch control: swipe, tap, home, power, volume.
 Audio streaming: device microphone → browser.
 Floating button on-device controls.
 Web control panel accessible from any browser.
Depends: firmware (>= 12.0), mobilesubstrate, com.rpetrich.rocketbootstrap
Maintainer: ZMMO
Author: ZMMO
Section: Utilities
